        "description": "<p>A plugin for convenient tag management.<br />\nWhen posting, any tags that exist on the page will be automatically registered.<br />\nYou can also register or delete tags for all pages at once.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20turn%20off%20the%20feature%20that%20automatically%20adds%20tags%20when%20posting%3F'>\nCan I turn off the feature that automatically adds tags when posting?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Can be turned on/off with a checkbox.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
